Package: openmediavault-seagate-nas2bay
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: laserbirdx <https://github.com/laserbirdx>
Depends: openmediavault (>= 7.0), python3, ethtool
Recommends: seagate-nas2bay-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/laserbirdx/seagate-nas2bay-omv
Description: OpenMediaVault 7 hardware plugins for the Seagate NAS 2-Bay (n090201 / SRPD20)
 Native OMV 7 plugins for the Seagate NAS 2-Bay (Marvell Armada 370):
  - Fan & Thermal: 4-step gpio-fan control (0/950/1400/1800 RPM), auto curve
  - LED & Night Mode: all 6 chassis LEDs, presets, hourly sleep schedule
  - Chassis Buttons: short/long press actions for Sync, Power and Reset
  - One-Touch USB Backup with folder naming, LED feedback and post-actions
  - Interactive "Hardware Overview" dashboard widget (front/rear chassis)
 English and Turkish (tr_TR) translations included.
